window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Revenge is a dish best-served cold, or so they say... For Julian White, revenge is a burning obsession that consumes him day and night. He's spent years honing his skills as an assassin, waiting for the perfect moment to strike back at the man who took everything from him.</p> <p>Now, he's finally found a way to get close to the King of Titans, the man responsible for the death of his family and the destruction of his clan. But it means playing a dangerous game, one that requires him to pretend to be something he's not. To infiltrate the inner circle of the man he hates most in the world, Julian must become a courtesan, using his body as a weapon to get close to the king.</p> <p>As he spends more time with Lucious Rex, Julian finds himself falling deeper into a web of desire and deception. Can he keep his emotions in check long enough to carry out his mission? Or will he be consumed by his own desire for revenge, risking everything he's worked for in the process?</p> <p>Only time will tell as Julian navigates the treacherous waters of court intrigue, betrayal, and seduction, all while keeping his true identity a secret. Will he emerge victorious, finally able to exact the revenge he's been dreaming of for years? Or will he fall prey to his own desires, losing everything he's ever fought for in the process?</p> <p>Warning: this is a MM historical fiction Viking romance, that includes dubious consent, mm romance werewolf shifters, mm paranormal romance, mm first-time romance, mentions of past sexual assault, enemies to lovers, assassination attempts, and a HEA.</p>"; 
